// `arcade.sdk.v1.InitRequest`. Starts the SDK's threads and its loopback RPC
// endpoint; fails without side effects if anything in the request is
// invalid or the port cannot be bound. Call once, before any other function
// except the three above.
//
// # Safety
// `init_request` must point to `len` readable bytes.
